                                "sense_id": "e36c0054-fc11-3e9f-b8b1-f0d32e82bde0",
                                "text": "For these causes Plutarch[…]gives a most especial charge to all parents, and many good cautions about bringing up of children, that they be not committed to undiscreet, passionate, bedlam tutors […]."
